              <td>27-28</td>
              <td>33-34</td>
              <td>17-18</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>M</td>
              <td>38-40</td>
              <td>28-29</td>
              <td>34-35</td>
              <td>18-19</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="comparison__row--highlight">
              <td>L</td>
              <td>40-42</td>
              <td>29-30</td>
              <td>35-36</td>
              <td>19-20</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>XL</td>
              <td>42-44</td>
              <td>30-31</td>
              <td>36-37</td>
              <td>20-21</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>2XL</td>
              <td>44-46</td>
              <td>31-32</td>
              <td>37-38</td>
              <td>21-22</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="comparison__row--highlight">
              <td>3XL</td>
              <td>46-48</td>
              <td>32-33</td>
              <td>38-39</td>
              <td>22-23</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>4XL</td>
              <td>48-50</td>
              <td>33-34</td>
              <td>39-40</td>
              <td>23-24</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
          <caption>Measurements are approximate. Custom sizing available with tech pack development. Tolerance ?0.5 inches.</caption>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--alt">
    <div class="section__container">
      <div class="section__header">
        <span class="section__label">Price Range</span>
        <div class="accent-line"></div>
        <h2 class="section__title">Sweatshirt Price Range by Style and MOQ</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="section__text">
        <p>Pricing varies by style complexity, fabric weight, and order quantity. FOB Bangladesh pricing for standard production runs. Customization, premium fabrics, and special finishes are additional. Volume discounts available for orders exceeding 1,000 pieces.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="comparison-wrapper">
        <table class="comparison">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Style</th>
              <th>300-500 pcs</th>
              <th>500-1000 pcs</th>
              <th>1000-2000 pcs</th>
              <th>2000+ pcs</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="comparison__row--highlight">
              <td>Crewneck (280 GSM)</td>
              <td>$8-12</td>
              <td>$7-10</td>
              <td>$6-9</td>
              <td>$5-8</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Half-Zip (280 GSM)</td>
              <td>$10-15</td>
              <td>$9-13</td>
              <td>$8-11</td>
              <td>$7-10</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Quarter-Zip (280 GSM)</td>
              <td>$10-15</td>
              <td>$9-13</td>
              <td>$8-11</td>
              <td>$7-10</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="comparison__row--highlight">
              <td>Raglan (280 GSM)</td>
              <td>$10-15</td>
              <td>$9-13</td>
              <td>$8-11</td>
              <td>$7-10</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Heavyweight Crewneck (320 GSM)</td>
              <td>$12-18</td>
              <td>$11-16</td>
              <td>$10-14</td>
              <td>$9-12</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Organic Cotton Crewneck (GOTS)</td>
              <td>$14-22</td>
              <td>$13-20</td>
              <td>$12-18</td>
              <td>$11-16</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
          <caption>FOB Bangladesh pricing. Includes fabric, cut, sew, basic branding. Customization additional.</caption>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section__container">
      <div class="section__header">
        <span class="section__label">Sweat Sets</span>
        <div class="accent-line"></div>
        <h2 class="section__title">Matching Sweat Sets | Crewneck Sweatshirts and Sweatpants</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="section__text">
        <p>Sweat sets featuring matching crewneck sweatshirts and sweatpants are increasingly popular for loungewear, athleisure, and brand collections. The coordinated look provides visual consistency and brand recognition. We produce sweat sets in the same fabric weight and color, ensuring perfect matching between tops and bottoms.</p>
        
        <p>Sweat set production requires coordinated manufacturing to ensure color consistency across both garment types. Our integrated production capability ensures that sweatshirts and sweatpants from the same order match perfectly in fabric, color, and construction details. This coordination eliminates the risk of mismatched sets that can occur when sourcing tops and bottoms from different suppliers.</p>
        
        <p>Minimum order for sweat sets is 300 pieces per set style, with the quantity representing the combined total of tops and bottoms. For example, a 300-piece sweat set order could be 150 sweatshirts and 150 sweatpants, or any other combination totaling 300 pieces. This flexibility allows brands to balance their inventory based on expected sales ratios while meeting the production minimum.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--alt">
    <div class="section__container">
      <div class="section__header">
        <span class="section__label">Frequently Asked Questions</span>
        <div class="accent-line"></div>
        <h2 class="section__title">Sweatshirt Manufacturer FAQ</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq">
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">What is the difference between sweatshirt and hoodie?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">Sweatshirts have crewneck neckbands without hoods. Hoodies have attached hoods with drawstrings. Sweatshirts are simpler in construction, making them ideal for screen printing and embroidery. They offer a clean neckline suitable for layering under jackets.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">What sweatshirt styles do you manufacture?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">We manufacture crewneck sweatshirts (standard, oversized, fitted), half-zip sweatshirts with chest zippers, quarter-zip sweatshirts with collar necklines, and raglan sweatshirts with contrast sleeve panels. All styles available from 300 pieces minimum.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">What fabric weights do you offer for sweatshirts?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">We offer 240 GSM lightweight sweatshirts for spring/summer, 280 GSM midweight for standard year-round wear, 320 GSM heavyweight for winter and premium positioning, and 380 GSM extra-heavyweight for maximum warmth and premium streetwear.</p>
